--
<div style="text-align:center;">
<b>The recycling plant burns down.</b><br>
</div>

<div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:60px 1fr; column-gap:20px; width:100%; margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:10px; align-items:start;">

<div style="white-space:nowrap;">
<img src="images/circularity.webp" style="height:25px; position:relative; top:5px;"> :&nbsp;<img src="images/down.webp" style="height:25px; position:relative; top:5px;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</div>

<div style="width:100%;">
less ability to recycle old smartphones and materials<br>
</div>

</div>

