:: End2 {"position":"850,1975","size":"100,100"}
Here is the state of Phonopolis after your legislative period:
<div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:80px 1fr; column-gap:20px; width:100%; margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:0px; align-items:center;">

<div style="white-space:nowrap;">
<img src="images/circularity.webp" style="height:25px; position:relative; top:5px;"> = {circle}
</div>

<div style="width:100%; line-height:1;">
[if circle < 4]
Your choices did not really improve the **circularity** of the economy.
[continue]
[if circle > 3 && circle < 5]
Your choices were not very efficient in building a **circular** economy.
[continue]
[if circle > 4 && circle < 8]
You have improved the **circularity** of the economy.
[continue]
[if circle > 7 && circle < 11]
You have improved the **circularity** of the economy significantly.
[continue]
[if circle > 10]
You improved the **circularity** of the economy tremendously.
[continue]
</div>

</div>

<div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:80px 1fr; column-gap:20px; width:100%; margin-bottom:0px; align-items:center;">

<div style="white-space:nowrap;">
<img src="images/good.webp" style="height:25px; position:relative; top:3px;"> = {happy}
</div>

<div style="width:100%; line-height:1;">
[if happy < 3]
People are not very **happy** with your choices.
[continue]

[if happy > 2 && happy < 7]
The **happiness** of the people did not change much.
[continue]

[if happy > 6 && happy < 10]
People are quite **happy** with your choices.
[continue]

[if happy > 9]
People are very **happy** with your choices.
[continue]
</div>

</div>

<div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:80px 1fr; column-gap:20px; width:100%; margin-bottom:0px; align-items:center;">

<div style="white-space:nowrap;">
<img src="images/money.webp" style="height:25px; position:relative; top:5px;"> = {money}
</div>

<div style="width:100%; line-height:1;">
[if money < 2]
You barely managed not to go bankrupt.
[continue]

[if money > 1 && money < 5]
You have less **money** left than what you started with.
[continue]

[if money > 4 && money < 6]
You spent as much **money** as you earned.
[continue]

[if money > 5]
You earned more **money** than you spent.
[continue]
</div>

</div>





[if happy > 0]
<div style="text-align:center;">
[[Continue->End3]]
</div>


:: End3 {"position":"1000,2025","size":"100,100"}
config.header.right: " "
config.footer.center: "[[Credits->End.Credits]]"
final: 2.5*circle + 1.5*happy + money
--
<div style="text-align:center;">
[if final > 50]
<img src="images/very-good.png" style="height:50px; position:relative; top:3px; right:5px;"> <img src="images/very-good.png" style="height:50px; position:relative; top:3px; right:5px;"> <img src="images/very-good.png" style="height:50px; position:relative; top:3px; right:5px;"> <br>
**You've hit the high score! Congratulations!**

[if final > 32.7 && final <50.1]
<img src="images/very-good.png" style="height:50px; position:relative; top:3px; right:5px;"> <br>
Your score is {final} of 50. <br><br>
You have been an outstanding mayor for Phonopolis. **Congratulations!** <br>

[if final > 28.7 && final <32.6]
<img src="images/good.png" style="height:50px; position:relative; top:3px; right:5px;"> <br>
Your score is {final} of 50. <br><br>
You have been a good mayor for Phonopolis. 

[if final > 22.7 && final <28.6]
<img src="images/neutral.png" style="height:50px; position:relative; top:3px; right:5px;"> <br>
Your score is {final} of 50. <br><br>
You have been an avarage mayor for Phonopolis. 

[if final > 14.7 && final <22.6]
<img src="images/bad.png" style="height:50px; position:relative; top:3px; right:5px;"> <br>
Your score is {final} of 50. <br><br>
You have been a poor mayor for Phonopolis. 

[if final <14.6 && final >2]
<img src="images/bad.png" style="height:50px; position:relative; top:3px; right:5px;"> <br>
Your score is {final} of 50. <br><br>
You barely survived this legislative period in Phonopolis.


[if final > -5]
[[Run for office again|Start]]
</div>

<div style="font-size:15px; text-align:right;">
<br>
[[Learn more about the score->End4]]
<div style="text-align:right;">



:: End4 {"position":"1000,2150","size":"100,100"}
config.footer.left: " "
config.footer.center: "[[Restart|Start]]&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;  [[Credits->End.Credits]]"
--
The score is calculated from the values for circularity, happiness and your left over budget. 

Score = 2.5 * <img src="images/circularity.webp" style="height:25px; position:relative; top:5px;"> + 1.5 * <img src="images/good.webp" style="height:25px; position:relative; top:3px;"> + 1 * <img src="images/money.webp" style="height:25px; position:relative; top:5px;">

With the values from your current game, you reached:<br>
Score = 2.5 * {circle} + 1.5 * {happy} + 1 * {money} = {final}

