:: Round1 {"position":"850,300","size":"100,100"}
config.footer.center: "Round 1/6"
--

Choose one of the possible new policies by clicking on it.

<span class="policy">[[EXTREME ECO-TAX]]</span>
(High fees for environmental impact.)

<span class="policy">[[MOBILE DETOX DAY]]</span>
(On Saturdays, all phones remain off.)

<span class="policy">[[RETURN DEPOSIT]]</span>
(Mandatory deposit when buying a new phone, to ensure recycling.)


:: Round2 {"position":"850,550","size":"100,100"}
config.footer.center: "Round 2/6"
--

Your chosen policy will stay in effect. You can choose an additional one now.

<span class="policy">[[SCHOOL REPAIR CAFÉ]]</span>
(New school subject: "Introduction to Cell Phone Repair".)

<span class="policy">[[PHONE SUBSCRIPTION]]</span>
(A new phone every year.)

<span class="policy">[[ONE-PHONE LAW]]</span>
(Only one cell phone per person.)


:: Round3 {"position":"850,800","size":"100,100"}
config.footer.center: "Round 3/6"
--

Choose one of the possible new policies by clicking on it.

<span class="policy">[[BYOD]]</span>
(Bring Your Own Device. Secure second profile instead of work phone.)

<span class="policy">[[YOUTH PROTECTION]]</span>
(Cell phones only from the age of 18.)

<span class="policy">[[SERVICE CONTRACT]]</span>
(Cell phone repair insurance.)


:: Round4 {"position":"850,1075","size":"100,100"}
config.footer.center: "Round 4/6"
--

Choose one of the possible new policies by clicking on it.

<span class="policy">[[DON'T PHONE AND DRIVE]]</span>
(High penalties for using a phone while driving.)

<span class="policy">[[SUSTAINABLE DEVICES ACT]]</span>
(Phones must have easily removable and recyclable components.)

<span class="policy">[[RECYCLE BONUS]]</span>
(Swap old phone for new one.)


:: Round5 {"position":"850,1350","size":"100,100"}
config.footer.center: "Round 5/6"
--

Choose one of the possible new policies by clicking on it.

<span class="policy">[[NO EXPLOITATIVE FEATURES]]</span>
(Limit game design elements that manipulate players into addictive behavior.)

<span class="policy">[[CONSUMPTION LIMIT]]</span>
(Users can only buy a new phone every three years.)

<span class="policy">[[BIO PHONE]]</span>
(Tax advantages for building phones with biodegradable components.)


:: Round6 {"position":"850,1600","size":"100,100"}
config.footer.center: "Round 6/6"
--

Choose one of the possible new policies by clicking on it. (This will be the last round.)

<span class="policy">[[LIMIT ONLINE FOOTPRINT ]]</span>
(Default digital minimalism features (e.g., screen time locks, usage reports).

<span class="policy">[[UNLOCK]]</span>
(Requires all phones over 2 years old to be legally unlockable.)

<span class="policy">[[CLOSED-LOOP LAW]]</span>
(Manufacturers must use 15% recycled materials from old phones.)


